    "description": "Marina District...Opportunity awaits at this incredible location . Conveniently located steps from the iconic Chestnut street shops and restaurants , Marina Green, Moscone Park and so much more. This Duplex property features Two 3 bedroom 2 full bath units, 3 car garage parking w/ a workshop and storage area and walkout to a private outdoor rear patio area. The Interior features elegant period details with elevated and open beam ceilings, hardwood flooring, arched entries and Terrazzo entryways. Both units have formal dining areas w/ breakfast rooms. First floor unit has an additional exterior garden patio area accessible from the formal dining room. Roof access from the property provides potential opportunity to add an additional level or outdoor space featuring amazing views of the city, bay and the GG Bridge. Your possibilities are endless. Bring your contractor and designer to discover the full potential of this historic property. Virtual staging was utilized with photography for the vacant unit."
  },
